      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bennett%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Each fall, Bennett celebrates its heritage with the Flatwoods Festival, followed by a festive Christmas parade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
